  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nFIFA 20 marks another strong entry in the long-running football simulation franchise from EA Sports. Blending polished realism with fresh modes, it invites players to master both traditional 11-a-side matches and smaller-sided street-style showdowns. With refined ball physics, smarter AI, and the inventive new VOLTA mode, FIFA 20 offers fans multiple ways to play – whether you’re crafting your dream squad in Ultimate Team, competing in stadiums worldwide, or taking the game to urban courts.<p></p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Authentic Game Flow / Football Intelligence</b>: The gameplay has been re-worked so that AI players better understand space, time and positioning; you’ll see more realistic one-on-ones, smarter defending, and smoother player motion.\n</li><li><b>Decisive Moments</b>: More control is given to players in key situations – e.g., new dribbling mechanics like Strafe Dribbling, new tackling options (Controlled Tackling), an overhauled finishing system (Composed Finishing) and improved set-piece mechanics.\n</li><li><b>Enhanced Ball Physics</b>: The ball behaves more realistically – spins, bounces, shot trajectories (knuckleballs, dips, swerves) are all improved to add nuance and authenticity.\n</li><li><b>Expanded Ultimate Team (FUT) Features</b>: More tools to build your dream club, including new customization options for crests, kits, stadium themes, tifos; new “Milestone” challenges; and a “FUT Friendlies” mode for more casual play.\n</li></ul>\n",
